  </section>

  <section class="proof">
    <div class="container grid-3 animate-fade-in-up delay-4">
      {proofPoints.map((point) => (
        <div class="card proof-card" style={`border-top: 3px solid ${point.color}`}>
          <h3>{point.title}</h3>
          <p>{point.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-studies-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Case studies</span>
        <h2>Sales problems, solved like an engineer</h2>
        <p class="lede">Each of these started as a bottleneck in my own pipeline. I built a system to remove it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3 studies animate-fade-in-up">
        {caseStudies.map((study) => (
          <a href={study.href} class="card study-card">
            <span class="chip chip-blue">{study.tag}</span>
            <h3>{study.title}</h3>
            <p>{study.body}</p>
            <span class="read-more">Read the case study →</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="positioning">
    <!-- Ambient glow behind card -->
    <div class="ambient-glow glow-positioning"></div>
    <div class="container narrow relative">
      <div class="card positioning-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">Why this combination matters</span>
        <h2>A sales rep who builds sales tech</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Most SDRs run the playbook. I rebuild it. From cold-calling scripts refined over
          thousands of dials to a live data dashboard adopted across a UK SaaS company,
          the pattern is the same: take a messy, manual process and turn it into a
          repeatable system that the whole team benefits from.
        </p>
        <p class="margin-0">
          <a href="/about/" class="btn btn-ghost">More about my path →</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="enterprise-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="card band-card">
        <div class="band-info">
